{"author":[{"collection_id":"Authors","document_content":{"avatar":{"file_path":"_f68a99ffe9144467a917320028f1ce3b_/_50ac3cbb26fa4c21a9967e26675f94c5_/e542d55e05d06e63bbf3dadd467d6f4889a15a6c2c43b46c812a48b6ee2adf7ff126e17cb0d3c04d4d2f24d216f00138ed4cd9cbf209538cb1bd0f4fd7ac7f15","height":2000,"url":"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/ECgal03qq-GPHfoWRZft82d97qPwwB-M4z1d-igDCWWAMWhJteOVP4HzaU2XhhQVfG9ME-_0DWTFA1eK28kgnTgTHBpSnTIhLK8TQKwE0zyq_lFckrs","width":2000},"name":"James Williams","title":"Material Developer Advocate"},"document_id":5856972825690112,"document_label":null,"repo_id":"mio-example"}],"body_content":[{"code_snippet":["```java\n* accent\n* onAccentColor\n* accentContainer\n* onAccentContainer\n```","```java\nColorRoles getColorRoles(@ColorInt int color,\n   boolean isLightTheme);\n```","```java\n  val button = view.findViewById<Button>(R.id.button_first)\n  val green = resources.getColor(R.color.green, null)\n                // or Color.parseColor(\"#FF1BA132\")\n  val roles = MaterialColors.getColorRoles(green, true)\n\n  button.setBackgroundColor(roles.accentContainer)\n  button.setTextColor(roles.onAccentContainer)\n```"],"content":"<p>早在 10 月的 <a href=\"https://developer.android.com/events/dev-summit\">Android Dev Summit</a> 上，我们就发布了面向 Material Design Components (MDC) 的 Material Design 3 预览版。</p>\n<p>现在，我们准备宣布 MDC 1.5.0 稳定版发布，带来更多 Material Design 3 支持、组件修复以及更多颜色工具。你可以<a href=\"https://github.com/material-components/material-components-android/releases/tag/1.5.0\">在这里</a>查看发布说明。</p>\n<p>如果你去年推迟了迁移，现在是探索新设计体系的绝佳时机。除了上面列出的资源之外，还有两个值得重点关注的部分：Material 3 Catalog 应用和扩展颜色工具。</p>\n<h2>Material 3 Catalog 应用</h2>\n<p>我们的工程团队使用 Material Catalog 应用来验证并展示与 Material Design 相关的新组件和新功能的示例实现。它是了解新设计体系的绝佳资源。</p>\n<p>如果你尚未迁移到 Material 3 和动态颜色（dynamic color），catalog 应用提供了一个设置区域，让你可以查看默认浅色、深色或用户生成的主题在整个应用中的呈现效果。</p>\n<p>&lt;mio-col-set cols=2&gt;</p>\n<p>&lt;mio-column&gt;</p>\n<p>&lt;mio-image index=0&gt;&lt;/mio-image&gt;</p>\n<p>&lt;/mio-column&gt;</p>\n<p>&lt;mio-column&gt;</p>\n<p>&lt;mio-image index=1&gt;&lt;/mio-image&gt;</p>\n<p>&lt;/mio-column&gt;</p>\n<p>&lt;/mio-col-set&gt;</p>\n<p>你可以<a href=\"https://github.com/material-components/material-components-android/releases/download/1.5.0/catalog-debug.apk\">在这里</a>下载 apk 文件。每个屏幕还提供了按组件组织的源代码，可供<a href=\"https://github.com/material-components/material-components-android/tree/master/catalog/java/io/material/catalog\">查阅</a>。</p>\n<h2>扩展颜色工具</h2>\n<p>同样是在 Android Dev Summit 上，我们发布了面向 <a href=\"https://www.figma.com/community/plugin/1034969338659738588/Material-Theme-Builder\">Figma</a> 和<a href=\"https://material-foundation.github.io/material-theme-builder/\">网页端</a>的 Material Theme Builder。它为设计师和开发者提供了体验动态颜色和 Material 3 主题的途径，并支持导出为代码。</p>\n<p>&lt;mio-image index=2&gt;&lt;/mio-image&gt;</p>\n<p>Material Theme Builder 受到社区的欢迎，令我们喜出望外。我们也听到你们表示，希望纳入标准关键色之外的更多颜色角色。目前，尽管我们展示了这些颜色的可视化效果，但对于每个扩展（非关键）颜色，我们只导出其种子色（seed color）。</p>\n<p>&lt;mio-image index=3&gt;&lt;/mio-image&gt;</p>\n<p>为迎接库中即将推出的更多颜色特性，MDC 1.5.0 在 MaterialColors 类中加入了一个名为 <code>getColorRoles</code> 的函数，它会返回：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><code>accent</code></li>\n<li><code>onAccentColor</code></li>\n<li><code>accentContainer</code></li>\n<li><code>onAccentContainer</code></li>\n</ul>\n<p>完整的函数签名如下：</p>\n<p>&lt;mio-code-snippet index=1&gt;&lt;/mio-code-snippet&gt;</p>\n<p>借助这个 ColorRoles 对象，你可以在运行时重新设置组件的主题。在下面的代码片段中，我们更改了按钮的 colorContainer 和 onColorContainer 值。请始终记得：在更改 colorContainer 色调时，要重新评估 onColorContainer（文本）色调，以确保文本具有适当的对比度和可读性。</p>\n<p>&lt;mio-code-snippet index=2&gt;&lt;/mio-code-snippet&gt;</p>\n<p>&lt;mio-col-set cols=3&gt;</p>\n<p>&lt;mio-column&gt;</p>\n<p>&lt;mio-image index=4&gt;&lt;/mio-image&gt;</p>\n<p>&lt;/mio-column&gt;</p>\n<p>&lt;mio-column&gt;</p>\n<p>&lt;mio-image index=5&gt;&lt;/mio-image&gt;</p>\n<p>&lt;/mio-column&gt;</p>\n<p>&lt;mio-column&gt;</p>\n<p>&lt;mio-image index=6&gt;&lt;/mio-image&gt;</p>\n<p>&lt;/mio-column&gt;</p>\n<p>&lt;/mio-col-set&gt;</p>\n<h2>MDC 的下一步是什么？</h2>\n<p>我们正在全力开发 MDC 的下一个主要版本。你可以在 GitHub 上关注进展、提交<a href=\"https://github.com/material-components/material-components-android/issues/new?assignees=&amp;labels=bug&amp;template=bug_report.md&amp;title=%5BComponent+name%5D+Short+description+of+issue\">错误报告</a>和<a href=\"https://github.com/material-components/material-components-android/issues/new?assignees=&amp;labels=feature+request&amp;template=feature_request.md&amp;title=%5BComponent+name%5D+Short+description+of+request\">功能请求</a>。也欢迎随时通过 Twitter 联系我们：<a href=\"https://twitter.com/materialdesign\">@materialdesign</a>。</p>","image":[{"a11y_description":"Home screen of Material Components Catalog App","bordered":true,"caption":null,"case":null,"file":{"file_path":"_f68a99ffe9144467a917320028f1ce3b_/_f3e8a4f639ce4c5aafa231fcb8daa630_/c18bdefa9aad92cd5057c6b23d6030dff7a9255874ff630d6ace8f79a77809f1f5286d007d16d00d972af52a608096e805917d35ec16b78de6cccfa022eba6a6","height":1920,"url":"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/tRsZvSk4VuvHJmxG6czy4eljvcVjV2RmPxQ5UBfkMuLy_vuzMrbLyfs2CNYY7G0Mc9qrfGaeMTlcPCVkK_G_ZaqSwOdB68h7Tgvtq6OH21nzcMR2QGg","width":1080}},{"a11y_description":"Theme and Dynamic Color Settings Selection in Material Components Catalog App","bordered":true,"caption":null,"case":null,"file":{"file_path":"_f68a99ffe9144467a917320028f1ce3b_/_f3e8a4f639ce4c5aafa231fcb8daa630_/2c1930e9466e0e2c0f5068ab1dd880d41892218e0243320b216bcf1eaf5c6ce532863f5a86d610d099918d2852fd4733135fce0fbc104981c646a2ee2a5a380d","height":1920,"url":"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/xwFFAMhc52NEO9Ke0v_ysbqXlppp3hRlqc5bXBZx4Z015-y41-Yt7x-GeRZnqqoelzz222yIt-05A8StJzEf6qafjl06b2qvp9PM-7FPDIvN19enI9Ob","width":1080}},{"a11y_description":"Default UI of Material Theme Builder","bordered":true,"caption":null,"case":null,"file":{"file_path":"_f68a99ffe9144467a917320028f1ce3b_/_f3e8a4f639ce4c5aafa231fcb8daa630_/82e13b70968bd60c7c6dc5794aac5eb50d5827845a75a9e0cd476bc72adf4be1516aea3e830357a67d29795625dcd37a559670869a95df45bfe643a0ce15b7cf","height":996,"url":"https://lh3.googleuser